  "title": "Essex Announces Release and Conference Call Dates for Its First Quarter 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "Essex Property Trust, Inc. (NYSE:ESS) announced today that it plans to release its first quarter 2026 earnings after the market closes on Tuesday, April 28, 2026. A conference call with senior management is scheduled for Wednesday, April 29, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time or 1:00 p.m. Eastern Time. The first quarter conference call is open to everyone and can be accessed by: Internet: Go to www.essex.com ; click on Investors and the first quarter earnings webcast. Phone: Dial toll-free, (877) 4",
